      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "……うん、ミシディア建国の立役者として\r\nばっちりサクラの名前が載ってるぞ！",
        "official_en": "...It’s right here—your name is clearly stated as the founder of Mysidia.",
        "real_en": "...Yeah, your name's right here as one of the people who helped found Mysidia!"
      },
