        "official_en_sha256": "43be04e704f981587b645530de1a36de190af6bcddcd6b06f9ce8f6ccdd70dae"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "その人、ミシディア建国の話題が出た時に\r\nサクラが気まずそうだったことと関係あるのか？",
        "official_en": "But does she have anything to do with why you were being so evasive earlier?",
        "real_en": "Does she have something to do with why you looked so uncomfortable when Mysidia's founding came up?"
      },
